cpu-temp-monitor (1.1.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * service: report status correctly when the service is inactive instead of
    printing an error (systemctl status exits non-zero while still inactive)
  * service: make the worker script robust to starts during seconds 08/09 and
    stop sourcing the INI file (logged a spurious error every start)
  * logging: keep CSV columns aligned on append and harden the legacy-log
    conversion (deterministic header order, ast.literal_eval, correct timestamp)
  * build: install the CLI as 0755 so non-root users can run it
  * docs: document the systemd service instead of the removed cron command

 -- Ivan Herrera Casas <ivanhc.pp@gmail.com>  Tue, 26 May 2026 09:00:00 -0500

